# dotnet.ps1 and global.json are NOT ignored on purpose: .github/workflows/release.yml
# runs ".\dotnet.ps1 --info" to bootstrap the pinned SDK, and global.json is what pins
# it. Ignoring them dropped both from the repo and every release build failed at the
# bootstrap step with "The term '.\dotnet.ps1' is not recognized".
